  title "Light and Heat"
  summary "Fimalin, an Aurora-trained ice reader, works with Nightshelf operatives Silvmococriaa~ and ☽'mortoth at the corrupted vault of Dawn Naong to recover krill-bloom memory-traces fouled by the Tide End Incident. After initial conflict over methodology, Silvmococriaa~ reveals that thermal mapping can guide light-based readings through the corruption, leading them to develop a hybrid technique combining aurora crystals with fire-core heat-mapping. Over nine hours across two days, they successfully read seven memory-layers and produce a prediction for eastern shallows krill blooms that proves accurate eleven days later, though the technique exists only partially documented across their separate traditions and cannot be easily replicated."
